SOUTH WESTERN AREA

Bath had talks on home safety by Mrs A. Baker, Home Safety Officer, Avon; on Bath education from 1870-1970 by Dr Horace Brand, Education Officer for Bath; on foundation garments by Mr Pidgeon, Bayers; and a ‘Beetle drive’. Bodmin had a celebration dinner to mark the 10th anniversary of the Branch; a cookery demonstration by Miss Julie Horton, SWEB; and invited several other local organisations to a wiring and information evening on the theme, ‘Knowledge cuts costs’ speakers included Miss Julie Horton, Home Service Adviser, SWEB who spoke on ‘You and Your bill’;
